\newlabel{tab:harmful_removal}{{3}{10}{Removal test: mean $\Delta $AUC after deleting MinPPI--harmful features vs.\ matched-budget controls (mean $\pm $ std over 5 seeds). All methods delete exactly $|\mathcal {H}_{0.95}|$ features. \emph {Positive} $\Delta $AUC means deletion \emph {improves} performance. $|F|_{\text {removed}}$ is the fraction of features deleted by all methods}{table.3}{}}
